# Root-level project files that are not Mintlify docs pages.
# Excluded so the Mintlify Deployment PR check does not try to parse
# them as documentation (they have no frontmatter and fail its parser).
#
# README.md, LICENSE.md, CHANGELOG.md, and CONTRIBUTING.md are ignored
# automatically by Mintlify and do not need to be listed here.
AGENTS.md
CLA.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
REPRODUCIBILITY.md
SECURITY.md
osf-registration.md
